iv class="steps"><article><h3>The objective</h3><p>What you want to accomplish.</p></article><article><h3>The environment</h3><p>Relevant systems, constraints, or timelines.</p></article><article><h3>The next step</h3><p>Exploring, assessing, building, or integrating.</p></article></div></div></section></main><?php require __DIR__.'/includes/footer.php';?>